<p><b>Gumm's Bio:</b>
<table border=1 width=400>
  <tr><td>
  <font face="Monotype Corsiva" size=5 color="#999966">I</font><font face="Arial" size=3 color="#999966">t wuz a dark mornin in da swamp of Innothule, an meez had bin bashin da liddle creechurs fer mee mornin wurkout. It wuz only wen meez return to da town of Oggok dat meez see sumthin odd...<br><br>

<font face="Monotype Corsiva" size=5 color="#999966">A</font><font face="Arial" size=3 color="#999966">s mee enter da town, der wuz 2 elveses standin der, all cleen an pale skinnd an lookin at meez in disgust. Dey told me dey had bin bashin da gaurds of Oggok an dey laff. Den dey dissapeer inta da swamp, leevin da town. Meez glad dey leev but me filld wit rage, meez wuz only a yung wartrior and dem 2 high elveses haz too much power fer Gumm ta bash.. me wish dat Rallos Zek wud giv meez da mor power ta kill da pale skins.<br><br>

<font face="Monotype Corsiva" size=5 color="#999966">A</font><font face="Arial" size=3 color="#999966">fta a kwik visit to da warrior guild ta train in sum mor skillz, meez start headin bak out to da swamp fer sum mor bashin. Jus as meez gunna leev, a figur step out of da shadows, an evil lookin dark elf wit blak armor. He intradooz himselfs as da rogue Voness, him had seen da 2 high elveses leevins da town an him new dat meez waz very angry at dem. Him assure mee dat dey wud pay fer der wrong doins, an him grin evilly. Voness cud see dat meez wuz gunna grow inta da big basher sumday an him tell meez of da Bloodhorde family; how der am mor evil peepl like himself an how dey wurk togetha ta rid Norraths land of da followerz of da light gods. Voness tell meez ta wurk hard at bashin till meez am a bit older den meez wud be considerd fer joinin da ranks of da Bloodhorde.<br><br>

<font face="Monotype Corsiva" size=5 color="#999966">D</font><font face="Arial" size=3 color="#999966">at wuz a long time ago, wen meez wuz jus a liddle basha. Over da many weeks of da bashin meez lern lots mor bout Norrath an bout da evil an good peepl. Meez hav gud times bashin an seen lota blood spill tings, meez bin huntin in sum gud places of da Norrath an bump inta a few of da Bloodhorde on me travels an meez no dat wun day meez cud be fightin along side dem.<br><br>

<font face="Monotype Corsiva" size=5 color="#999966">F</font><font face="Arial" size=3 color="#999966">inally, da day comes wen meez am old enuf fer da Bloodhorde, meez hav train hard an afta speekin an meetin wit da mighty warlord Runja, meez am finally a part of da family of evil Bloodhorde!<br><br>

<div align=center><b>- - - - - - - -</b></div><br><br>

<font face="Verdana" size=3 color="#FFFFFF">So dats me story an meez histry, meez hope yer enjoyd reedin it. An tank yer Voness an Runja an da otha Bloodhorde dat meez see befor (not namin yer all cuz der am a few of yooz an meez gut a bad memry fer all yer names, hahar!). So now meez can luk forwurd ta bashin wit all of yer, see yer soon!</font><br><br><br>

<font size=6 color="#FF0000"><div align=center><b>Gumm</b></div></font>
